            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thank you for your kind words!\r\n\r\nIt is not supported at the moment, but I plan in foreseeable future to allow custom definition of single character surroundings. So users can map themselves what is inserted and/or searched when they type, for example, `(` or `)`. This should cover your case and some others, like LaTeX operators and so on. Need to finish some other things, settle on the API and implement.",
